# Warden policy matrix: the actions each actor (column) may take on each resource
# (row); "-" means none. Fixture names only. Rewrite with `mix warden.matrix --update`.

policy Warden.Test.Ecto.Comments
actions read
resource          agent  api_key_read  guest  member  outsider  owner  webhook
comment_teamless  read   read          read   read    -         read   -

policy Warden.Test.Ecto.Issues
actions read read_trashed write
resource        agent  api_key_read  guest  member      outsider  owner                    webhook
issue_private   -      read          -      read,write  -         read_trashed             read
issue_public    read   read          -      read,write  -         read,read_trashed,write  -
issue_teamless  read   read          read   read        -         read,read_trashed        -
issue_trashed   -      -             -      -           -         read_trashed             -

policy Warden.Test.Ecto.Notes
actions read write
resource     agent  api_key_read  guest  member  outsider  owner       webhook
note_secret  -      -             -      -       -         read,write  -

policy Warden.Test.Ecto.OauthClients
actions read
resource   agent  api_key_read  guest  member  outsider  owner  webhook
client_t1  -      -             -      -       -         read   -

policy Warden.Test.Ecto.Projects
actions read
resource          agent  api_key_read  guest  member  outsider  owner  webhook
project_teamless  -      read          -      read    -         read   -

policy Warden.Test.Ecto.Summaries
actions read
resource      agent  api_key_read  guest  member  outsider  owner  webhook
summary_team  -      read          -      read    -         read   -

policy Warden.Test.Ecto.Teams
actions read
resource      agent  api_key_read  guest  member  outsider  owner  webhook
team_private  -      read          -      read    -         -      read
team_public   -      read          -      read    -         read   -

redacted
